OL,3,GNEWSAThe unlikely bond formed by an
OL,4,AIrish indie-folk band and an English
OL,5,Afootball club
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's a tale as old as time - take one
OL,8,F16-year-old video game, a rising
OL,9,Findie-folk band and a League One
OL,10,Ffootball team and what do you get?
OL,12,FA new football anthem for Wycombe
OL,13,FWanderers, courtesy of the unlikely
OL,14,Ffigures of Irish chart-toppers
OL,15,FKingfishr, whose singer was the special
OL,16,Fguest under the Tuesday night lights of
OL,17,Fthe club's Adams Park stadium this
OL,18,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
