OL,3,GNEWSAThe unlikely bond formed by an
OL,4,AIrish indie-folk band and an English
OL,5,Afootball club
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's a strange musical connection that
OL,8,Fall came about in a way avid fans of
OL,9,Fsports video games can understand - via
OL,10,FFifa 11, a game the band said they
OL,11,Fstarted playing while recording their
OL,12,Fsecond album.
OL,14,FThe band adopted Wycombe Wanderers as
OL,15,Ftheir team in the game and eventually
OL,16,Fposted a song for the club, which has
OL,17,Fracked up more than 190,000 views on
OL,18,FTikTok.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
